<view class="page-shell identity-page"><td-topbar title="驾驶证认证"/><view class="page-content">
 <view class="status-card card"><view class="status-row"><view><view class="status-title">当前认证状态</view><view class="status-sub">认证后可在公开主页展示驾驶资质</view></view><view class="pill {{status === 'APPROVED' ? 'green' : status === 'PENDING' ? 'orange' : status === 'REJECTED' ? 'red' : ''}}">{{status === 'APPROVED' ? '已认证' : status === 'PENDING' ? '审核中' : status === 'REJECTED' ? '审核拒绝' : '未提交'}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{rejectReason}}" class="reject-text">拒绝原因：{{rejectReason}}</view></view>
 <view class="form-card card"><view class="field"><view class="label">驾驶证姓名</view><input class="input" value="{{form.holderName}}" data-field="holderName" bindinput="onInput" maxlength="64" placeholder="请输入驾驶证上的姓名" disabled="{{status === 'PENDING' || status === 'APPROVED'}}"/></view><view class="field"><view class="label">驾驶证号</view><input class="input" value="{{form.licenseNo}}" data-field="licenseNo" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="请输入驾驶证号" disabled="{{status === 'PENDING' || status === 'APPROVED'}}"/></view><view class="field"><view class="label">准驾车型</view><input class="input" value="{{form.vehicleClass}}" data-field="vehicleClass" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="如：C1" disabled="{{status === 'PENDING' || status === 'APPROVED'}}"/></view><view class="field"><view class="label">签发机关（选填）</view><input class="input" value="{{form.issuingAuthority}}" data-field="issuingAuthority" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="请输入签发机关" disabled="{{status === 'PENDING' || status === 'APPROVED'}}"/></view><view class="images"><view class="upload" data-side="front" bindtap="choose"><image wx:if="{{frontPath}}" src="{{frontPath}}" mode="aspectFill"/><block wx:else><image class="upload-icon" src="/assets/icons/contact.svg"/><text>驾驶证正面（必填）</text></block></view><view class="upload" data-side="back" bindtap="choose"><image wx:if="{{backPath}}" src="{{backPath}}" mode="aspectFill"/><block wx:else><image class="upload-icon" src="/assets/icons/file-pen-line.svg"/><text>驾驶证背面（必填）</text></block></view></view></view>
 <view class="notice"><view class="notice-title">资料安全</view><view>驾驶证号会加密保存。姓名、证件号、准驾车型及正反面材料齐全后自动通过，并在后台保留认证记录。</view></view><view wx:if="{{status !== 'PENDING' && status !== 'APPROVED'}}" class="primary-btn submit-btn {{loading ? 'disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onSubmit">{{loading ? '认证中…' : status === 'REJECTED' ? '重新提交认证' : '上传材料并自动认证'}}</view>
</view></view>
